{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19201","headline":"酬乐天偶题酒瓮见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬乐天偶题酒瓮见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从君勇断抛名後，世路荣枯见几回。\n门外红尘人自走，瓮头清酒我初开。\n三冬学任胸中有，万户侯须骨上来。\n何幸相招同醉处，洛阳城里好池台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}